    'Encode (minimal + named): Tom & Jerry <3 → Tom &amp; Jerry &lt;3. Encode (non-ASCII + hex): © 😀 → &#xA9; &#x1F600;. Decode: &lt;p&gt;Tom &amp; Jerry &copy; &#x1F600;&lt;/p&gt; → plain text `<p>Tom & Jerry © 😀</p>` in the preview.',
